				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.224999)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Strip below the neck: NO exposed copper. After assembly dip-coat strip in 2-part epoxy or PU (100-200 um), seal routed edges."
		(at 145 51 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "729bce76-7943-43f1-8c75-071ce9c19c0f")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.224999)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Head routing (RS -> ESP32 touch pins, LoRa SPI, power) is still to be done by hand."
		(at 145 60 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "7f099474-8c0d-4c56-a721-668a370d6a98")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.224999)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Pads: P1 = +7..+5 cm ... P12 = -15..-17 cm; pump OFF when P2 wet (+5 cm), ON when P11 dry (-15 cm)."
		(at 145 57 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "95dfa0d4-3cb3-4945-9ecc-b27929764a3a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.224999)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Stack: F.Cu pads (no mask opening) / In1 GND (hatched under pads) / In2 sense traces + GND / B.Cu solid GND."
		(at 145 48 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "be5e0b9d-eb66-4221-a8a9-283195e9ac05")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.224999)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Head lives in a sealed 50 mm PVC end cap; SMA -> pigtail -> 866 MHz antenna on a 1.5 m pole."
